  "category": "查找阅读-代码",
  "files": {
    "bin/refresh.sh": "#!/bin/sh\nset -eu\n. ./lib/refresh.sh\nrefresh_mirror \"$@\"\n",
    "lib/refresh.sh": " . ./lib/manifest.sh\nrefresh_mirror() {\n    mirror_manifest \"$1\"\n}\n",
    "lib/manifest.sh": " . ./lib/checksum.sh\nmirror_manifest() {\n    checksum_index \"$1/Packages.gz\"\n}\n",
    "lib/checksum.sh": "checksum_index() {\n    sha256sum \"$1\"\n}\nchecksum_release() {\n    sha512sum \"$1\"\n}\n",
    "conf/mirror.env": "MIRROR_SUITE=stable\nMIRROR_ARCH=arm64\n",
    "README.md": "# apt-mirror-refresh\n\nSmall service for apt mirror refresh.\n\nOperational entry: `bin/refresh.sh`. Paths are relative to the project root.\n"
